  "changes": [
    "Fixed cycle-hiding literal calls: import options, transparent parentheses, extra arguments, optional require, parenthesized callee, generic TypeScript require and import-equals require.",
    "Replaced four ast-grep passes with one iterative native tree-sitter cursor walk; preserved recovered-syntax rejection, quotas, literal decoding and path resolution.",
    "Checked source length before native parsing to prevent truncation beyond the u32 offset domain; covered 2048 nested parentheses without recursive Rust traversal.",
    "Removed ast-grep-core, bit-set and bit-vec; retained the same native parser and grammar versions.",
    "Bound mutation cases and outcomes to fresh source/test/configuration hashes; reject stale reviews, duplicate controllers and tool-version mismatches without hashing generated Cargo caches.",
    "Added sanitizer fuzzing of the actual production extraction path with an independent generated-literal oracle in JavaScript, TypeScript and TSX.",
    "Removed .gitlab-ci.yml and active GitLab CI guidance; retained upstream Rust-OE repository provenance. GitHub Actions is the project CI."
